# LQS application JS

- Extend cards via `LQS_NodeTypes['type']` subclasses of `LQS_Node`, not one-off DOM in the shell.
- Register new types in the `index.php` script list (order matters until modules exist).
- Layout I/O shapes live in node `.data`; round-trip through `getLayout` / `setLayout`.
- Geometry: virtual coords + `toReal` / `toVirtual`; reuse `LQS_Point` / `LQS_Line`.
- Seeds: `makeSeed` / `growSeed` / `attachSeed` — do not invent a second provisional-node system.
- Inputs that need normal clipboard behaviour need class `normal-paste`.
- On substantial rewrites, JSDoc public methods; prefer modules/types if introducing a build step.
- After structural changes, update `AGENTS.md`.
